  "agent_notes": [
    "The NIRF listing name is abbreviated as DDU Government Degree College, while the matching official Saidabad, Prayagraj site uses the expanded name Deen Dayal Upadhyay Government Post Graduate College.",
    "The official Courses page lists B.A., B.Com., B.Sc., M.A. and M.Sc. degree programmes and subject offerings; no separate diploma, certificate or doctoral programme is listed. Co-curricular and vocational syllabi on that page are not standalone credentials and were excluded.",
    "Physical Education is listed under B.A. subjects on the official Courses page and appears in the official 2026–27 admission fee structure; it is included despite being omitted from the admission-page course summary and eligibility table.",
    "The official site does not state a delivery mode for these programmes, so mode is recorded as not stated on official website.",
    "Normal TLS verification produced the managed proxy self-signed certificate-chain error; public GET requests were retried with curl --insecure only after confirming the expected official and government hostnames."
  ]
}
